>> title: S'mores Bars
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: chocolate, marshmallow, graham, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery
>> aka: smores bars, s'mores squares, graham marshmallow bars
>> servings: 9
>> time: 55 min
>> step.5: layer dough, chocolate, marshmallow, dough

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Line an #8x8-in pan{} with parchment.

Beat @unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g) with @light brown sugar{1/2%cup}(100 g), @egg{1%large}(50 g), and @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL).

Fold @all-purpose flour{1 1/4%cup}(160 g), @graham cracker crumbs{3/4%cup}(75 g), @baking powder{1%tsp}(4 g), @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g) into @&(~1)butter mixture{}.

Press half of @&(~1)dough{} into the pan, lay @milk chocolate bars{7%oz}(200 g) over it, spread @marshmallow creme{7%oz}(200 g) on top, and cover with the rest of the dough.

Bake @&(~1)bars{} at 350°F for ~{30%min}.
